! AICIRA nonlinear baseline diagnostic controls; ANSYS Mechanical Commands object.
! N-mm-MPa model units. Apply to COPIES of the two nonlinear analyses.
! Physical restraints and prescribed top UZ=-1.6 mm remain in Mechanical.
! Do not use a second conflicting Analysis Settings substep specification.
/SOLU
NLGEOM,ON
AUTOTS,ON
NSUBST,200,20000,200
NROPT,FULL
NEQIT,50
PRED,OFF
LNSRCH,AUTO
STABILIZE,OFF
EQSLV,SPARSE
OUTRES,ALL,ALL
